Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:08:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/19] Show a session's status dot on its tab

Session::setStatusIndicator gives a session a colored dot, which its tab
shows in place of its icon. It is meant for plugins that track what the
session's program is doing; an invalid color removes the dot. Bell,
activity and silence notifications, broadcast and read-only icons still
take precedence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
